# Backend. The ingest service lives solely on the home server, in
# ~/Docker/budget-ingest, and deploys by editing there and rebuilding the
# container - nothing about it reaches Vercel, so nothing about it needs to be
# here. It was tracked until now, which gave it two copies: a fix landed in
# this one in September and never reached the server, so the running parser
# stayed three days stale and kept mis-reading outgoing RAAST transfers.
/ingest/

